<li><strong>Apple TV</strong>: &#36;199, up from &#36;129 (+&#36;70)</li><br/>
<li><strong>iPad</strong>: &#36;449, up from &#36;349 (+&#36;100)</li><br/>
<li><strong>iPad mini</strong>: &#36;599, up from &#36;499 (+&#36;100)</li><br/>
<li><strong>iPad Air</strong>: &#36;749, up from &#36;599 (+&#36;150)</li><br/>
<li><strong>iPad Pro</strong>: &#36;1,199, up from &#36;999 (+&#36;200)</li><br/>
<li><strong>MacBook Neo</strong>: &#36;699, up from &#36;599 (+&#36;100)</li><br/>
